          "name": "Maintenance Planning",
          "href": "/blueprint?area=area-maint"
        },
        "situation": "Train 3 high-pressure pump tripped on low suction pressure at 02:14 during a filter backwash.",
        "observed_signals": [
          "Suction pressure dipped to 1.1 bar for 4 s",
          "Backwash of media filter F-06 started 02:13",
          "No VFD fault codes"
        ],
        "expert_reasoning": "Backwash draw on the filtered-water tank pulled suction below the trip setpoint. Setpoint had no time delay.",
        "recommended_response": "Added 3 s delay on low-suction trip; staggered backwash starts against Train 3 run hours.",
